            "review_text": "beribache\n6 contributions\n0\nUpscale Izakaya experience\nJul 2024 • Couples\nFUGU offers a luxurious take on the classic Japanese izakaya. The ambiance is sleek and modern, providing a sophisticated backdrop for enjoying their extensive menu. Service was attentive and friendly throughout. While some dishes could be considered pricier, the overall quality and experience make FUGU well worth considering for a special night out.\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2024",
