            "review_title": "Review at Fugu Modern Izakaya & Bar",
            "review_text": "Williams M\nGermany10 contributions\n0\nThe first Modern Izakaya & B in HCM\nJun 2024 • Couples\nm the moment you step inside, you're greeted with a chic ambiance, complete with a stunning bar adorned with a captivating koi fish lantern. While they offer an extensive drink menu with various price points, the star of the show is their unique culinary offerings. Where else can you find expertly prepared pufferfish alongside classic Japanese dishes? The quality is undeniable, with fresh ingredients and beautiful presentation. Whether for a business dinner, a romantic evening, or a special occasion, FUGU delivers an unforgettable experience. \nWe highly recommend checking out their live music on Saturdays and exploring their membership program for exclusive perks!!!!\nRead more\nWritten July 16, 2024",
