            "review_title": "Review at Fugu Modern Izakaya & Bar",
            "review_text": "Amghar\nRome, Italy3 contributions\n0\nAn elevated Izakaya Experience in District 1\nJun 2024 • Couples\nLocated on the bustling Dong Khoi street, its prime location and sophisticated ambiance make it ideal for impressing clients or a special date night. We were blown away by the unique menu featuring hard-to-find delicacies like pufferfish prepared in various ways - all incredibly fresh and safe! The presentation was exquisite, and the signature dishes like the braised pork belly and the seared tuna sushi were bursting with flavor. While the price point is above average, the quality of the food, service, and atmosphere make it worth every penny. \nDon't miss their impressive bar and happy hour deals!\nRead more\nWritten July 13, 2024",
