            "review_text": "Ledjridi M\n1 contribution\n0\nUnforgettable culinary journey at FUGU\nJul 2024 • Couples\nWe were impressed by their extensive menu, featuring everything from classic Japanese dishes to Western favorites. Their skilled Japanese chef, with over 30 years of experience, uses only the freshest ingredients, evident in the exquisite presentation and taste of each dish. We highly recommend their premium tuna and salmon rolls and the pan-seared tuna tartate. With its impressive drink selection, including an array of whiskeys, wines, and champagnes, FUGU caters to every taste and occasion!!!!\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2024",
