            "review_title": "Review at Fugu Modern Izakaya & Bar",
            "review_text": "Faryad H\n5 contributions\n0\nA modern izakaya gem in the heart of Saigon\nJul 2024 • Couples\nFUGU Modern Izakaya & Bar, nestled on the bustling Dong Khoi Street, offers a unique and upscale dining experience. The menu boasts a fusion of Asian and European delights, with an impressive selection of cocktails and a dedicated sake menu. We opted for their signature pufferfish hotpot, a rare and meticulously prepared delicacy that was both visually stunning and bursting with delicate flavors. The attentive service and live music on Saturday night elevated our experience. With its prime location, sophisticated atmosphere, and exceptional cuisine, FUGU is perfect for special occasions, business dinners, or a memorable date night.\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2024",
